Steps to configure S2S VPN (Crypto Map)

1. Set a ISAKMP Policy (Phase 1)

conf t
 crypto isakmp policy 1
  authentication pre-share
  encryption aes 256
  hash sha512
  group 14
  lifetime 86400
  exit
 crypto isakmp key VPN-Bkey address __.__.__.__
  end


2. Define Interesting Traffic

conf t
 access-list 100 permit ip __.__.__.__  __.__.__.__  __.__.__.__  __.__.__.__
 end

3. Set a IPSec Transform-set (Phase 2)

conf t
 crypto ipsec transform-set IPSEC_SET esp-aes esp-sha512-hmac
  mode transport
  exit
 crypto map VPN_MAP 1 ipsec-isakmp
  set peer 10.2.2.1
  set transform-set IPSEC_set
  match address 100
  end

4. Apply IPSec to tunnel

conf t
 int e0/0
  crypto map VPN-MAP
  end

